# Local development only — committed on purpose so every dev run (and the e2e
# suite) sees one stable portal identity. Without a seed each workerd isolate
# invents its own AID, so an OOBI resolved at login can name a different
# identity than a later request. The deployed worker sets VERIFIER_SEED as a
# secret.
